
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>StudyMate AI - 회원가입</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="auth-body">
  <div class="auth-card">
    <div class="logo">✦ StudyMate AI</div>
    <h1>회원가입</h1>
    <p class="muted">나만의 스마트 학습 공간을 만들어 보세요.</p>

    <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="error"><%= error %></div>
    <% } %>

    <form action="/register" method="POST">
      <label>이름</label>
      <input name="username" placeholder="이름을 입력하세요" required maxlength="50">

      <label>이메일</label>
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="example@email.com" required maxlength="100">

      <label>비밀번호</label>
      <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="8자 이상" required minlength="8">

      <label>비밀번호 확인</label>
      <input type="password" name="passwordConfirm" placeholder="비밀번호 다시 입력" required>

      <button class="primary-btn" type="submit">회원가입하기</button>
    </form>

    <p class="center muted">
      이미 계정이 있나요? <a href="/login">로그인</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
